GIVEN uma IS A BOOLEAN, here IS A BOOLEAN, unl IS A BOOLEAN, tmp IS A BOOLEAN, shev IS A BOOLEAN, pv IS A BOOLEAN, req IS A BOOLEAN, det IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `My s 46A facts`
`s 46A facts of` uma here unl tmp shev pv req det MEANS `My s 46A facts` WITH
    `I am an unauthorised maritime arrival` IS uma
    `I am in Australia` IS here
    `I am an unlawful non-citizen` IS unl
    `I hold a bridging visa, a temporary protection visa, or a temporary visa of a kind prescribed for s 46A(1)(b)(ii)` IS tmp
    `I hold a safe haven enterprise visa, or have held one and am a lawful non-citizen` IS shev
    `the visa I apply for is prescribed for s 46A(1A)(b)` IS pv
    `I meet the work, study or social security requirements prescribed for s 46A(1A)(c)` IS req
    `the Minister has determined under s 46A(2) that the bar does not apply to me for this class of visa, and the determination is in effect` IS det

