GIVEN zone IS A BOOLEAN, ref IS A BOOLEAN, can IS A BOOLEAN, left IS A BOOLEAN, notice IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `My s 48A facts`
`s 48A facts of` zone ref can left notice MEANS `My s 48A facts` WITH
    `I am in the migration zone` IS zone
    `a protection visa application made by me or for me while I was in the migration zone has been refused` IS ref
    `a protection visa I held was cancelled` IS can
    `I have left the migration zone since, other than by a removal or attempted removal after which s 48A(1A) or (1AB) treats me as having stayed` IS left
    `the Minister has given me a notice under s 48B and I apply within its period` IS notice

