-- ss 91V, 91W, 91WA
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GIVEN asked IS A BOOLEAN, refused IS A BOOLEAN, warned IS A BOOLEAN, insincere IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `My oral statement`
`statement of` asked refused warned insincere MEANS `My oral statement` WITH
    `I was asked to make an oral statement on oath or affirmation that my information is true` IS asked
    `I refused or failed to make it` IS refused
    `when asked I was warned the Minister may draw an unfavourable inference about my credibility if I refused or failed` IS warned
    `the Minister has reason to believe, from the manner of my statement or my demeanour, that I was not sincere` IS insincere

