GIVEN req IS A BOOLEAN, fail IS A BOOLEAN, warned IS A BOOLEAN, bogus IS A BOOLEAN, destroyed IS A BOOLEAN, expl IS A BOOLEAN, docs IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `My identity documents`
`documents of` req fail warned bogus destroyed expl docs MEANS `My identity documents` WITH
    `I was asked to produce documentary evidence of my identity, nationality or citizenship` IS req
    `I refused or failed to comply, or produced a bogus document in response` IS fail
    `when asked I was warned the Minister cannot grant the visa if I did so` IS warned
    `I provided a bogus document as evidence of my identity, nationality or citizenship` IS bogus
    `the Minister is satisfied I destroyed or disposed of such evidence, or caused that` IS destroyed
    `the Minister is satisfied I have a reasonable explanation` IS expl
    `I have produced documentary evidence of my identity, nationality or citizenship, or taken reasonable steps to` IS docs

