-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- ss 338A, 347A: who can apply to the ART
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GIVEN dec IS A `The decision about me`, gr IS A `The ground of the decision`, cc IS A BOOLEAN, pers IS A BOOLEAN, thenz IS A BOOLEAN, nowz IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `My review facts`
`review of` dec gr cc pers thenz nowz MEANS `My review facts` WITH
    `the decision` IS dec
    `the ground` IS gr
    `the Minister has issued a conclusive certificate for the decision` IS cc
    `the Minister personally cancelled my protection visa` IS pers
    `I was physically in the migration zone when the decision was made` IS thenz
    `I am physically in the migration zone now` IS nowz

`a plain refusal` MEANS `a refusal to grant me a protection visa`
`no excluded ground` MEANS `none of the grounds below`

#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `no excluded ground` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a cancellation of my protection visa` `no excluded ground` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a cancellation of my protection visa` `no excluded ground` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 338A(2)(b) is about cancellations only; a refusal is not caught by it.
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `no excluded ground` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `no excluded ground` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `s 5H(2): the Minister's serious reasons (war crimes, serious non-political crime, acts against the United Nations)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `s 36(1B) or an ASIO assessment that I am a risk to security` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a cancellation of my protection visa` `s 36(1C): the Minister considers me a danger to security or the community` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `s 36(2C)(a) or (b)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a decision under s 197D(2) that I am no longer owed protection` `s 36(2C)(a) or (b)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `no excluded ground` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `a plain refusal` `no excluded ground` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I apply to the ART question` (`review of` `another decision` `no excluded ground` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

