#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply to the ART question` (`on` 17 11 2026) FALSE TRUE (`on` 16 12 2026) (`on` 20 12 2026) EQUALS `out of time: the ART cannot extend the period (s 347(5)) and cannot review the decision (s 348)`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply to the ART question` (`on` 17 11 2026) FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 2000) (`on` 15 12 2026) EQUALS `not yet late: the period has not ended`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply to the ART question` (`on` 17 11 2026) FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 2000) (`on` 16 12 2026) EQUALS `out of time: the ART cannot extend the period (s 347(5)) and cannot review the decision (s 348)`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply to the ART question` (`on` 17 11 2026) TRUE TRUE (`on` 1 12 2026) (`on` 20 12 2026) EQUALS `yes: I applied within the period (s 347(3))`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply to the ART question` (`on` 17 11 2026) TRUE TRUE (`on` 2 12 2026) (`on` 20 12 2026) EQUALS `out of time: the ART cannot extend the period (s 347(5)) and cannot review the decision (s 348)`
