GIVEN fin IS A BOOLEAN, found IS A BOOLEAN, quashed IS A BOOLEAN, ended IS A BOOLEAN, asked IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `My removal facts`
`removal of` fin found quashed ended asked MEANS `My removal facts` WITH
    `my last valid protection visa application has been finally determined` IS fin
